{"title": "HTTP vs UDP Overlay: An Agent Benchmarking Method", "slug": "benchmarking-http-vs-udp-overlay", "section": "blog", "description": "A reproducible method for comparing HTTP and an agent overlay across cold and warm connections, direct and relayed paths, latency, throughput, and recovery.", "seoTitle": "HTTP vs UDP Overlay: An Agent Benchmarking | Pilot Protocol", "author": "Pilot Protocol editorial team", "publishedAt": "2026-02-26T12:00:00.000Z", "tags": ["benchmark", "performance", "data"], "content": {"root": {"type": "root", "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "An HTTP-versus-overlay benchmark is useful only when it compares the same route, security policy, payload, and connection lifecycle. Otherwise, it measures topology choices rather than transport behavior.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This guide defines a reproducible benchmark plan for agent communication. It deliberately avoids publishing universal winner numbers: a direct path, relay path, cold TLS handshake, warm HTTP/2 connection, and persistent encrypted tunnel are different experiments.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "heading", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Start with the Decision You Need to Make", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "tag": "h2"}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Write the operational question before choosing metrics. Typical questions include:", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "list", "children": [{"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "What is the cold-start cost of contacting an agent for the first time?", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 1}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "How does a warm connection behave under normal request volume?", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 2}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "What changes when the target is behind NAT or direct traversal fails?", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 3}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "How much CPU and memory does each option use at expected concurrency?", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 4}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "How quickly does communication recover after an IP change or process restart?", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 5}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "listType": "bullet", "start": 1, "tag": "ul"}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Do not combine these into one headline score. A team choosing an interactive control channel may care about warm tail latency and recovery, while a bulk-transfer workload may care about sustained throughput and CPU per byte.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "heading", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Define a Fair Test Matrix", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "tag": "h2"}, {"type": "table", "children": [{"type": "tablerow", "children": [{"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 1, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dimension", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 1, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cases to record", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 1, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Why it matters", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablerow", "children": [{"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Topology", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Same host, LAN, cross-region, direct overlay, relay overlay", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Path length often dominates protocol overhead", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablerow", "children": [{"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lifecycle", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cold setup, warm reuse, reconnect, failover", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Persistent and per-request designs pay costs at different times", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablerow", "children": [{"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Payload", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Small control message, typical JSON, large transfer", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Framing and copies scale differently", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablerow", "children": [{"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Concurrency", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "1, expected steady state, expected peak", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Queues and multiplexing appear under load", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablerow", "children": [{"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Security", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Equivalent authentication and encryption requirements", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Plaintext versus encrypted is not a fair comparison", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablerow", "children": [{"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Delivery", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Best effort, acknowledgement, retry, persistence", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "tablecell", "headerState": 0, "colSpan": 1, "rowSpan": 1, "backgroundColor": null, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Stronger guarantees consume resources", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "heading", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Separate Reachability from Transport", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "tag": "h2"}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "HTTP can work across any network that provides a route to the server. That route might come from public ingress, a reverse proxy, a VPN, a private link, or an overlay. Pilot includes registry and beacon coordination to attempt direct UDP traversal and use encrypted relay fallback when needed.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Measure these as distinct paths:", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "list", "children": [{"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reachable HTTP service:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "the client already has a route to the server.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 1}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Direct Pilot path:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "coordination succeeds and payloads travel peer to peer.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 2}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Relayed Pilot path:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "direct traversal fails and encrypted payloads use the relay.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 3}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "HTTP plus reachability infrastructure:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "include the proxy, tunnel, or private-network path actually required in production.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 4}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "listType": "number", "start": 1, "tag": "ol"}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This prevents an invalid conclusion such as attributing an extra network hop to HTTP framing or crediting UDP for infrastructure that was omitted from the baseline.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "heading", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Collect Metrics that Explain the Result", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "tag": "h2"}, {"type": "list", "children": [{"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Connection readiness:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "time until the application can exchange an authenticated message.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 1}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Latency:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "p50, p95, and p99 for a fixed payload and concurrency.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 2}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Throughput:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "useful application bytes per second, not wire bytes alone.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 3}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Resource use:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "CPU time, resident memory, allocations, file descriptors, and network bytes.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 4}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reliability:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "error rate, timeout rate, reconnect time, and recovery after path loss.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 5}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Path state:", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "text", "text": "direct or relayed, plus any broker, proxy, or gateway hop.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 6}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "listType": "bullet", "start": 1, "tag": "ul"}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Report sample count, warm-up policy, confidence intervals, host specifications, operating-system versions, client versions, and every non-default setting. Retain raw observations instead of publishing only an aggregate table.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "heading", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "A Reproducible Procedure", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "tag": "h2"}, {"type": "list", "children": [{"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Provision identical client and server hosts and record their configuration.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 1}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Measure baseline path latency and packet loss without the application protocol.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 2}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Apply equivalent encryption, identity, and authorization requirements.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 3}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Run cold and warm cases in separate processes.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 4}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Randomize candidate order and repeat enough times to show variation.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 5}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Capture client, server, coordination, gateway, broker, and relay telemetry where applicable.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 6}, {"type": "listitem", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Publish the harness, configuration, raw output, and analysis script with the result.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "value": 7}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "listType": "number", "start": 1, "tag": "ol"}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "A benchmark that cannot be rerun is an observation, not a durable product claim. If some component is private, label the result as internal and avoid presenting it as an independently reproducible comparison.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "heading", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Using Pilot's Built-in Connectivity Benchmark", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "tag": "h2"}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pilot includes a benchmark command for exercising the Pilot path against a target agent. Use it to measure your own deployment, and retain its output with the route state and versions used:", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "block", "version": 2, "format": "", "fields": {"id": "1ba8cd20d8d002cb97a3838a", "blockName": "", "blockType": "Code", "language": "bash", "code": "# Run against a target Pilot address in your environment\npilotctl bench 1:0001.0002.0003"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This command does not create a complete HTTP comparison by itself. A fair cross-protocol study also needs a retained HTTP harness with equivalent payload handling, connection reuse, authentication, encryption, and reporting.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "heading", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "How to Interpret the Outcome", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "tag": "h2"}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "If both candidates reuse warm connections over the same physical route, small agent messages may be dominated by network round-trip time. A relay or proxy hop may matter more than framing. For sustained transfers, congestion control, copies, runtime behavior, and host limits become more visible.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "The result should inform an architecture decision, not produce a universal league table. HTTP supplies an application interface over a reachable path. Pilot supplies identity-aware reachability and encrypted paths that can carry existing application protocols. Compare the complete systems required for your deployment.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "For that broader responsibility map, read ", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "link", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "where Pilot fits with TCP, gRPC, and NATS", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 3, "fields": {"linkType": "custom", "url": "/blog/pilot-vs-tcp-grpc-nats-comparison", "newTab": false}, "id": "bd8c9daf5a063c06961e5aa4"}, {"type": "text", "text": ".", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "heading", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Benchmark Your Actual Route", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "tag": "h3"}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Start with one representative service, preserve the harness and raw output, and compare cold, warm, direct, and relayed paths separately.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "link", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "View the Pilot source", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 3, "fields": {"linkType": "custom", "url": "https://github.com/pilot-protocol/pilotprotocol", "newTab": true}, "id": "ddb928b8855648d8607d938c"}, {"type": "text", "text": "About this article", "format": 1, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Published by the Pilot Protocol team. Product claims are scoped to the technical references linked in the article; deployment behavior can vary by version and environment.", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "link", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "How we publish", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 3, "fields": {"linkType": "custom", "url": "/about#publishing", "newTab": false}, "id": "5c6e0616e57f3abc5984f2b0"}, {"type": "text", "text": " · ", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "link", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Suggest a correction", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 3, "fields": {"linkType": "custom", "url": "/contact?topic=correction", "newTab": false}, "id": "4c30d80902f4d7492c4051e9"}, {"type": "text", "text": " · ", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}, {"type": "link", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Technical references", "format": 0, "detail": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 3, "fields": {"linkType": "custom", "url": "/docs/research", "newTab": false}, "id": "cd07a606c457c9be588d099d"}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "textFormat": 0, "textStyle": ""}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}}}